  "question": {
    "text": "A steel wire with mass per unit length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is under tension of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>70</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>. The speed of transverse waves in the wire will be:",
